cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the accompanying manuscript when using this code."
title: "alarm-burden-calibration: linked-reward calibration of threshold-replayed alarm burden"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, simulation study, synthetic tests, figure-generation sources and
  manuscript files for linked-reward calibration of recorded clinical alarms, a method
  that anchors threshold replay of stored vital-sign measurements to the alarms a
  bedside monitor recorded.
type: software
license: MIT
